<section class="practice" aria-labelledby="consulting">
<h2 id="consulting">Consulting</h2>
<p>When delivery is slow or stuck, the cause is rarely where the symptoms show. It might be in how teams are shaped, how decisions get made, or how the organisation is structured.</p>
<p>We find it, then work inside the organisation to change it through the work itself, not from the sidelines with a report. We work directly with leadership teams in government, financial services, healthcare and large charities.</p>
<p class="aside">Writing, playbooks and talks on this live at <a href="https://profound.fyi/">profound.fyi</a>.</p>
</section>

